   The ledger closes to machine precision, everywhere, always. lam1 > 0 stretches,
   lam3 < 0 compresses, and lam2 -- the INTERMEDIATE -- is the balanced one, the
   one sitting at the wash. That is not a choice. It is tr(S) = 0.

